User-&gt;&gt;&gt;RV: choose month, click Generate Review
RV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: generateMonthlyReview(month)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;RS: generate(month)
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS: getStatus(month)
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AS: healthScore(month)
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AS: habits(month)
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS: evaluateAll()
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PLR: find()
combinedFragment=alt~cf1 User RR; User: [no transactions in the month]
RS.&gt;F: throw NoDataException
F.&gt;RV: error message
..=cf1; User: [data available]
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC: handle(AgentTask MONTHLY_REVIEW)
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;MM: buildContext(task)
MM.&gt;AC: AgentContext (includes lastReviewSummary)
combinedFragment=loop~cf2 AC TM; AC:              [agent loop (see SD05) using BudgetStatusTool, InsightTool, TransactionQueryTool]
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PL: nextStep(ctx)
PL.&gt;AC: AgentStep
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM: execute(toolCall)
TM.&gt;AC: ToolResult
--=cf2
AC.&gt;RS: AgentResult (narrative, up to 3 ProposalDrafts)
combinedFragment=opt~cf3 RS AS; RS:          [agent failed or figures ungrounded]
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;RS +1: build metrics-only narrative
--=cf3
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS: createFromDrafts(drafts, traceId)
PS.&gt;RS: List of Proposal (protected categories filtered out)
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;RR: save(review)
RS.&gt;F: MonthlyReview
F.&gt;RV: MonthlyReview
RV.&gt;User: review text and number of pending proposals
